drawn independently from the distribution dist. RandomToeplitz[n, \\[Sigma]] \
for numeric \\[Sigma] is a shortcut for RandomToeplitz[n, \
NormalDistribution[0, \\[Sigma]]]. RandomToeplitz[n] assumes the standard \
normal distribution with zero mean and unit standard deviation.", 
